 "Discover Packages Standard library errors"
      " (contain) "import path"
           " (contain) "Discover Packages Standard library errors"
      " (contain) documentation
           " (contain) "Package errors implements functions to manipulate errors."
           " (contain) "The New function creates errors whose only content is a text message."
      " (contain) functions
           " (contain) As
                " (contain) signature
                     " (contain) "func As(err error, target any) bool"
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "As finds the first error in err's tree that matches target, and if one is found, sets target to that error value and returns true. Otherwise, it returns false."
           " (contain) Is
                " (contain) signature
                     " (contain) "func Is(err, target error) bool"
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "Is reports whether any error in err's tree matches target."
           " (contain) Join
                " (contain) signature
                     " (contain) "func Join(errs ...error) error"
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "Join returns an error that wraps the given errors. Any nil error values are discarded. Join returns nil if every value in errs is nil. The error formats as the concatenation of the strings obtained by calling the Error method of each element of errs, with a newline between each string."
           " (contain) New
                " (contain) signature
                     " (contain) "func New(text string) error"
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "New returns an error that formats as the given text. Each call to New returns a distinct error value even if the text is identical."
           " (contain) Unwrap
                " (contain) signature
                     " (contain) "func Unwrap(err error) error"
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "Unwrap returns the result of calling the Unwrap method on err, if err's type contains an Unwrap method returning error. Otherwise, Unwrap returns nil."
